mma\u202f2 exhibits, for every integer \\(k\\) with \\(0\\le k\\le n-2\\), a configuration that attains exactly \\(k\\) sunny lines.  \n\nHence the set of all admissible values of \\(k\\) is  \n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\{0,1,2,\\dots ,n-2\\}} .\n\\]"
